004. J,C,B are collinear [06] & F,C,B are collinear [03] & C,I,A are collinear [04] & E,C,A are collinear [01] & DE ⟂ AC [00] & DF ⟂ BC [02] & BC ⟂ JE [07] & AC ⟂ IF [05] ⇒  ∠FJE = ∠FIE [14]
