007. J,C,B are collinear [06] & C,H,B are collinear [10] & ∠JCK = ∠JIK [13] & I,F,K are collinear [09] & AC ⟂ IF [05] & DE ⟂ AC [00] & ∠JEF = ∠JIF [16] & BC ⟂ JE [07] & DF ⟂ BC [02] ⇒  ∠DFE = ∠(HJ-CK) [17]
008. J,C,B are collinear [06] & C,H,B are collinear [10] & BC ⟂ DF [02] ⇒  HJ ⟂ FD [18]
